#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:2
#: f12b23de08a84eaba300eca370f43471
msgid "The TCP Server APIs"
msgstr "TCP 伺服器 API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:5
#: fe47494ba14d4fb9adcee03d2266fa85
msgid "TCP Server setup API"
msgstr "TCP 伺服器設定 API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:7
#: 45a9d1ad07a34767ac04aeeccd24dac6
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API is used to create a TCP server. The server in "
"the protocol is usually used to connect and listen to the TCP clients and"
" handle the data from the clients."
msgstr "TCP 伺服器設定 API 用於建立 TCP 伺服器。協定中的伺服器通常用於連接和監聽TCP客戶端並處理來自客戶端的資料。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:35
#: 56af828fcaff44f89764e37e3401f851
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API is defined in the ``TCP_Server_Base`` class. The"
" parameters of the ``__init__`` method are as follows:"
msgstr "TCP 伺服器設定 API 在「TCP_Server_Base」類別中定義。 ``__init__``方法的參數如下："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:38
#: 73415eb9534b4232892abe715dd19948
msgid "``host``: The host IP address to bind the TCP server to."
msgstr "``host``：綁定 TCP 伺服器的主機 IP 位址。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:39
#: 743d0dd8358d4d73b856019f135f7fc4
msgid "``port``: The port number to bind the TCP server to."
msgstr "``port``：綁定 TCP 伺服器的連接埠號碼。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:40
#: d4ea2a0f827d40d39532e1eedebe09d4
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``max_clients``: The maximum number of concurrent clients the server can "
"handle (ignored when ``is_asynic_clients_io`` is ``True``)."
msgstr "``max_clients``：伺服器可以處理的並發客戶端的最大數量。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:42
#: cc2ca47995564864a9969cec6658a5cf
msgid "``port_add_step``: The step size for incrementing the port number."
msgstr "``port_add_step``：增加連接埠號碼的步長。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:43
#: 7497baff697e4215abc5af49d8f485eb
msgid "``port_range_num``: The number of ports to check in the range."
msgstr "``port_range_num``：範圍內要檢查的連接埠數。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:44
#: b92d2bd56ffa429c9a658d9605ffd6fc
msgid ""
"``max_file_transfer_thread_num``: The maximum number of threads for file "
"transfer operations."
msgstr "``max_file_transfer_thread_num``：檔案傳輸操作的最大執行緒數。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:45
#: 34fa772a9c1e4c508423a724898bb70f
msgid ""
"``is_hand_alloc_port``: A flag indicating whether to manually allocate "
"the port."
msgstr "``is_hand_alloc_port``：指示是否手動分配連接埠的標誌。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:46
#: 9cd58500366b4544b9319ae4ac7e1b35
msgid ""
"``is_input_command_in_console``: A flag indicating whether to input "
"commands in the console."
msgstr "``is_input_command_in_console``：指示是否在控制台中輸入指令的標誌。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:47
#: a40defddbfd54bf6956400c6505d1bdf
msgid "``max_custom_workers``: The maximum number of custom worker threads."
msgstr "``max_custom_workers``：自訂工作執行緒的最大數量。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:48
#: 50d020d04d414b8f87fbf28ec9d4d9c7
msgid ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``: A flag indicating whether the messages exchanged "
"with clients are RSA-encrypted (see :ref:`tcp-server-encrypted-channel-"
"api`)."
msgstr ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``：指示與用戶端交換的訊息是否經過 RSA 加密的標誌（請參閱 tcp-server-"
"encrypted-channel-api`）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:50
#: ec269b9426ab4c6c9ca03ab169e31de2
msgid ""
"``is_custom_keys``: An optional ``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` pair of "
"user-supplied RSA keys. Both files must exist, parse as PEM, and pair "
"with each other; an invalid pair is silently ignored and the default key "
"lookup is used instead (``None`` keeps the default lookup)."
msgstr ""
"``is_custom_keys``：可選的``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` 使用者提供的 RSA "
"金鑰對。兩個檔案都必須存在，解析為 PEM，並且相互配對；無效的對將被默默地忽略，並使用預設的鍵查找（``None`` 保留預設查找）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:54
#: ffd233033bcb4e84a63cfa96879d996f
msgid ""
"``is_asynic_clients_io``: A flag indicating whether clients are served by"
" asyncio coroutines on one event loop instead of one thread per client. "
"It lifts the ``max_clients`` limit, so a single server can hold thousands"
" of concurrent connections."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:58
#: 2971c756d64c47b29c7dc43be17aea92
msgid ""
"``is_debug``: A flag selecting how much detail is logged. With ``False`` "
"(the default) the server logs command content and execution results only;"
" with ``True`` it also logs the key steps of the execution process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:61
#: 522ebdeb322b4d01829957d9c127ccd5
msgid ""
"``is_print_log``: A flag indicating whether the server logs at all. With "
"``False`` it prints nothing, whatever ``is_debug`` says."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:64
#: d6045cf9839c4d5b95ea3a33982529a4
msgid "All parameters have default values:"
msgstr "每個參數都有預設值："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:66
#: 2856409378ff47e594a6c3b485f3896c
msgid "``host``: Default is ``'127.0.0.1'``"
msgstr "“主機”：預設為“127.0.0.1”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:67
#: e8924f1ed528408d8083e869edf8c7b7
msgid "``port``: Default is ``65432``"
msgstr "“連接埠”：預設為“65432”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:68
#: 2c455a345a824fe38d2b67405db1d58f
msgid "``max_clients``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_clients”：預設為“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:69
#: f6822ce835fa4e58b5408dbd0fc7a2ed
msgid "``port_add_step``: Default is ``1``"
msgstr "“port_add_step”：預設為“1”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:70
#: c4e2d53a04a3488db3d42d087c72f365
msgid "``port_range_num``: Default is ``100``"
msgstr "“port_range_num”：預設為“100”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:71
#: 761daed7beee4d1687945ab953775d09
msgid "``max_file_transfer_thread_num``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_file_transfer_thread_num”：預設為“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:72
#: 77126ac1ea4c45b48dada9822860ec1a
msgid "``is_hand_alloc_port``: Default is ``False``"
msgstr "“is_hand_alloc_port”：預設為“False”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:73
#: 54d4ab66c3624ed3b691de7a500d3a8d
msgid "``is_input_command_in_console``: Default is ``True``"
msgstr "“is_input_command_in_console”：預設為“True”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:74
#: 6f099c7fed5f46cdb8067211fbf9a1bf
msgid "``max_custom_workers``: Default is ``10``"
msgstr "“max_custom_workers”：預設為“10”"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:75
#: 69500f7e9015429dbb7b71f6e462b83e
msgid ""
"``is_extend_command``: Default is ``False`` (when ``True``, ``__init__`` "
"will not call ``start_TCP_Server()`` automatically)"
msgstr "“is_extend_command”：預設為“False”（當“True”時，“__init__”不會自動呼叫“start_TCP_Server()”）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:77
#: 56f981cd00634b4d98cf6ffb13082876
msgid ""
"``is_enable_encrypto``: Default is ``True`` (when ``True``, client "
"connections go through an RSA public-key exchange and all subsequent "
"messages are encrypted)"
msgstr "「is_enable_encrypto」：預設為「True」（當「True」時，用戶端連線將透過 RSA 公鑰交換，並且所有後續訊息都會被加密）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:80
#: 28bd86abb6f14e928935c7f8716213e4
msgid ""
"``is_custom_keys``: Default is ``None`` (a ``[pub_key_path, "
"pvt_key_path]`` list uses a user-supplied keypair instead of the default "
"``~/.ssh`` / generated keys)"
msgstr ""
"``is_custom_keys``：預設為``None``（``[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]`` "
"清單使用使用者提供的金鑰對而不是預設的``~/.ssh``/產生的金鑰）"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:83
#: d08a8fc3174c4f5a94e7a9f7c78a4103
msgid ""
"``is_asynic_clients_io``: Default is ``False`` (when ``True``, every "
"accepted connection is served by a coroutine on one asyncio event loop, "
"and ``max_clients`` is ignored)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:86
#: 4658c77adf444aefb4391a61a7b39c1b
msgid ""
"``is_debug``: Default is ``False`` (``True`` adds the execution-process "
"lines to the command/result lines)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:88
#: 577dcd823ccc4dee911d3eb10aeb68fe
msgid ""
"``is_print_log``: Default is ``True`` (``False`` silences every line the "
"server would print)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:91
#: 77a6508b3d364834b33eb0664d847c20
msgid ""
"The TCP Server Setup API will initialize all the necessary parameters and"
" resources for the TCP server."
msgstr "TCP 伺服器設定 API 將初始化 TCP 伺服器的所有必要參數和資源。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:94
#: 7e922e5686d14296a9e59dca99d4ec12
msgid ""
"*Note: By default ``TCP_Server_Base.__init__`` calls "
"``start_TCP_Server()`` to start the server automatically. If you set "
"``is_extend_command=True``, the instance will not auto-start and you "
"should call ``start_TCP_Server()`` manually when ready.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：預設情況下``TCP_Server_Base.__init__`` 呼叫``start_TCP_Server()`` "
"自動啟動伺服器。如果您設定“is_extend_command=True”，實例將不會自動啟動，您應該在準備好時手動呼叫“start_TCP_Server()”。"
" *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:105
#: fdf56f4e32544250985c9ec2bcb863b4
msgid ""
"In the `start_TCP_Server` method, we first create a TCP server socket and"
" bind it to the ``self.host`` and ``self.port`` which are initialized in "
"the ``__init__`` method."
msgstr "在`start_TCP_Server`方法中，我們先建立一個TCP伺服器套接字並將其綁定到在`__init__`方法中初始化的`self.host`和`self.port`。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:109
#: e5f3569eb58e43ef8d491c2d3abfa778
msgid ""
"*Note: The server socket which is set up in the `start_TCP_Server` method"
" is based on IPv4 form.*"
msgstr "*注意：`start_TCP_Server`方法中設定的伺服器套接字是基於IPv4形式的。 *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:112
#: ed2ec723c2dc42aead083c45dfd37df3
msgid ""
"Secondly, according to the ``self.is_input_command_in_console`` "
"parameter, we will start a thread to listen to the console input of the "
"server or not."
msgstr "其次，根據``self.is_input_command_in_console``參數，我們會啟動一個執行緒來監聽或不監聽伺服器的控制台輸入。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:116
#: a34a43c68f83466f8f0c19a3e17c9c3a
msgid "After that, a main loop to accept clients will be started."
msgstr "之後，將啟動接受客戶端的主循環。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:118
#: f3c1f0e8a02f4af99f7a52d428dce631
msgid ""
"*Note: there is another global variable ``self.running`` which is set to "
"``True`` after the server socket is successfully created. The "
"``self.running`` variable is used to control the main loop of the TCP "
"server, and it will be set to ``False`` when the server is shutting "
"down.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：還有另一個全域變數“self.running”，在伺服器套接字成功建立後，該變數將變為“True”。 ``self.running`` "
"變數用於控制 TCP 伺服器的主循環，當伺服器關閉時它將變為 ``False``。 *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:124
#: ad4c6edcf1904f76bcd47cb20bc6e496
msgid ""
"With ``is_asynic_clients_io=True`` the main loop is the asyncio event "
"loop instead: it accepts clients in non-blocking mode and schedules one "
"coroutine per connection, it never applies the ``max_clients`` limit, and"
" `stop` releases it so the loop can end."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:129
#: 3ed0ed580f824be78e4cfc7630ede013
msgid ""
"The main loop of the TCP server setup function first checks whether the "
"number of connected clients exceeds the maximum number of clients. The "
"maximum number of clients is defined by the ``self.max_clients`` argument"
" of the `TCP_Server_Base` class, which is initialized in ``__init__``."
msgstr "TCP伺服器設定函數的主循環首先檢查連線的客戶端數量是否超過最大客戶端數量。最大客戶端數量由「TCP_Server_Base」類別的「self.max_clients」參數定義，該參數在「__init__」中初始化。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:134
#: 31a6777aff2648e1abf3b310dfc52ab9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the number of the clients is already over the limit of the connect "
"number, the server will send an overload message and close the "
"connection. But if it does not exceed the limit, the server will set up a"
" client handler function `handle_client` and the server handler function "
"is defined as:"
msgstr "如果客戶端數量已經超過連線數量限制，伺服器將發送過載訊息並關閉連線。但如果沒有超過限制，伺服器將設定一個客戶端處理函數“handle_client”，伺服器處理函數定義為："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:146
#: b41d5de901c941d9a47e86c7285b15e5
msgid ""
"*Note: For more details of the `handle_client` function, see the :ref"
":`tcp-server-handling-information-api` section.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：有關“handle_client”函數的更多詳細信息，請參閱 :ref:`tcp-server-handling-information-"
"api` 部分。 *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:149
#: e2fa76c3575c435ea3af172ccedf978d
msgid "So what can the setup function do if it fails?"
msgstr "那如果setup函式運行失敗了怎麼辦呢？"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:151
#: 68af0e32e9b44d2896c40298d01a4906
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"First, the try-except block in the main server loop checks whether the "
"error is an ``OSError``. If it is, the main loop will exit directly."
msgstr "首先，主伺服器循環中的 try 和 except 程式碼區塊將偵測錯誤是否為「OSError」。如果是，主循環將直接退出。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:155
#: e7e82f3627e54e7ea79d40b4a560137b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Secondly, if the error is from the network socket, it first logs the "
"error message and also stops the server by calling the function `stop`. "
"And the stop function has been defined as:"
msgstr "其次，如果錯誤來自網路套接字，它會先輸出錯誤訊息，並透過呼叫函數「stop」來停止伺服器。停止函數定義為："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:164
#: 34034a052c3742c19dd190198ece2fe6
msgid ""
"To stop the TCP server, it first sets the ``self.running`` variable to "
"False, to stop the main loop of the server. After that, it calls the "
"`free_port` function to free the port which has been allocated. And the "
"`free_port` has been defined as:"
msgstr ""
"要停止 TCP 伺服器，它首先將「self.running」變數設為 "
"False，以停止伺服器的主循環。之後，它會呼叫“free_port”函數來釋放已指派的連接埠。 `free_port` 被定義為："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:175
#: 298fecfa9b964db8a944d80a53209545
msgid ""
"*Note: For more details of the `free_port` function, see the :ref:`tcp-"
"server-port-allocation-api` section.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：有關 `free_port` 函數的更多詳細信息，請參閱 :ref:`tcp-server-port-allocation-api` "
"部分。 *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:178
#: e764f567943a4d47a4b9af1ce5e28015
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"At the end of the operations, the TCP server closes all client sockets "
"stored in the ``self.clients`` dictionary and also closes the server "
"socket."
msgstr "在操作結束時，TCP伺服器將關閉字典變數「self.clients」中記錄的所有客戶端套接字，並關閉伺服器套接字。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:181
#: 732526c301b44bcf964ec57c352532e7
msgid ""
"*Note: The ``self.clients`` variable is a dictionary that maps client "
"address tuples to an info dictionary. The key is the client address tuple"
" (``(ip, port)``) and the value is a dictionary containing connection "
"details such as ``'socket'``, ``'address'``, ``'id'``, and "
"``'connected_time'``. See the example below which shows how entries are "
"stored.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：「self.clients」變數是一個字典，它將客戶端位址元組對應到資訊字典。鍵是客戶端位址元組（``(ip, "
"port)``），值是包含連接詳細資訊的字典，例如``'socket'``、``'address'``、``'id'`` "
"和``'connected_time'``。請參閱下面的範例，其中顯示了條目的儲存方式。 *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:203
#: d8c96ec2f2f6446abd399b48ab4cf3d8
msgid "TCP Server handling information API"
msgstr "TCP伺服器處理資訊API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:205
#: da9f468210f341859e1a33bdb70818fe
msgid ""
"The server handling information API documents the core TCP server methods"
" that manage client sockets, receive raw data, and send messages."
msgstr "伺服器處理資訊 API 記錄了管理客戶端套接字、接收原始資料和發送訊息的核心 TCP 伺服器方法。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:217
#: cb703083ad004140b1b9577efac74627
msgid ""
"`handle_client` is the main per-client handler in ``TCP_Server_Base``. It"
" is invoked after a client connection is accepted and is responsible for:"
msgstr "`handle_client` 是 `TCP_Server_Base` 中主要的每個客戶端處理程序。它在客戶端連接被接受後被調用，並負責："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:221
#: 9aa6745273d743a083ba318578d04c43
msgid ""
"adding the client entry into ``self.clients`` with socket, address, id, "
"and connected time"
msgstr "將客戶端條目新增至「self.clients」中，其中包含套接字、位址、id 和連接時間"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:222
#: ba34f3c9b4a44e8ab9580376561dc121
msgid "printing connection information and current client count"
msgstr "列印連線資訊和當前客戶端計數"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:223
#: 72905471823142158251e2e906cb5713
msgid "sending a welcome message to the client"
msgstr "向客戶發送歡迎訊息"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:224
#: 6c7bbe786c614b648a18ded6c44a9606
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"sending the ``/client_alloc_port_range`` information to that client "
"depending on the port allocation mode"
msgstr "根據連接埠分配模式向所有客戶端廣播“/client_alloc_port_range”訊息"

