#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:316
#: 1fd44b590f8f415d9b2431164c36bd82
msgid ""
"If a PEM private key exists at ``~/.ssh/id_rsa`` it is reused; otherwise "
"a fresh RSA-2048 keypair is generated into ``network_api/.Flow/pvt_key`` "
"(``server_priv.pem`` / ``server_pub.pem``). The exchanged public key is "
"always derived from the private key, so a rotated ``~/.ssh`` pair is "
