msgstr ""
"如果 PEM "
"私鑰存在於「~/.ssh/id_rsa」中，則它會被重複使用；否則，將在「network_api/.Flow/pvt_key」（「server_priv.pem」/「server_pub.pem」）中產生新的"
" RSA-2048 金鑰對。交換的公鑰始終來源自私鑰，因此會自動選取旋轉的「~/.ssh」對。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:321
#: b11359ce9da347fc92c81f187073088d
msgid ""
"A user-supplied keypair can be forced with ``is_custom_keys = "
"[pub_key_path, pvt_key_path]``: both files must exist, parse as PEM and "
"pair with each other (a probe encrypted with the public key must decrypt "
"with the private key); an invalid pair is ignored and the default lookup "
"is used."
msgstr ""
"可以使用「is_custom_keys = [pub_key_path, "
"pvt_key_path]」強制使用者提供的金鑰對：兩個檔案必須存在，解析為 PEM 並相互配對（使用公鑰加密的探針必須使用私鑰解密）；"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:326
#: 8ccc7318eb9140fd8045a43b55564e02
msgid ""
"Public keys received from clients are cached in "
"``network_api/.Flow/pub_key`` as ``client_<ip>_<port>.pem`` (the peer "
"endpoint the key came from; ``:`` is replaced with ``_`` so IPv6 literals"
" are safe on every platform, including Windows)."
msgstr ""
"從用戶端接收到的公鑰以“client_<ip>_<port>.pem”形式快取在“network_api/.Flow/pub_key”中（金鑰來自的對等端點；“:”被替換為“_”，因此"
" IPv6 文字在每個平台上都是安全的，包括 Windows）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:332
#: 0d7088d34297470f928b6ad0ca6189dc
msgid "Anti-MITM identity check (TOFU)"
msgstr "反 MITM 身份檢查 (TOFU)"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:334
#: df70f185352a49fb84bcf9390fd75bd1
msgid ""
"Every connection re-exchanges public keys in plaintext, and each side "
"records the peer in ``network_api/.Flow/pub_key/pub_key.json``: the key "
"is ``(ip, port)`` (a Python tuple of the endpoint the peer connected "
"from), the value is ``[<sha256 of the public key>, <public key PEM>]``."
msgstr ""
"每個連線都以明文形式重新交換公鑰，每一方都會在「network_api/.Flow/pub_key/pub_key.json」中記錄對等點：金鑰是「(ip,"
" port)」（對等點連接的端點的 Python 元組），值是「[<公鑰的 sha256>,<公鑰 PEM>」。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:339
#: 4e2c7f85989749d2aaea8c57222fdfc2
msgid ""
"First connection from an endpoint: the key is recorded and trusted (trust"
" on first use)."
msgstr "來自端點的首次連線：金鑰被記錄並受信任（首次使用時信任）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:341
#: 92d3a934009149cd863aa427f6efaa2e
msgid ""
"Later connection presenting the *same* key: accepted. If the endpoint "
"changed (dynamic IP / user-changed port) the record is moved to the new "
"``(ip, port)`` instead of being duplicated."
msgstr "稍後的連線顯示*相同*金鑰：已接受。如果端點變更（動態 IP / 使用者變更的連接埠），記錄將會移至新的「（ip，連接埠）」而不是重複。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:344
#: 554deaaa755d47b3a07de3bad9c40355
msgid ""
"Later connection presenting a *different* key for an already-recorded "
"endpoint: the connection is rejected (``/crypto_reject`` is sent and the "
"socket closed)."
msgstr "稍後的連線為已記錄的端點提供*不同的*金鑰：連線被拒絕（發送``/crypto_reject``並關閉套接字）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:348
#: f101fe4bbadf4ef886c76d74f231ef74
msgid ""
"Because the server-side record is keyed by the client's source port, a "
"client that rotates its keypair is only detected when it reconnects from "
"an unchanged endpoint; with OS-assigned ephemeral ports the new key is "
"recorded as a fresh endpoint. The client-side record is keyed by the "
"fixed server address, so a changed server key is always rejected. To "
"reset trust (rotated keys, new server), delete the ``pub_key.json`` entry"
" (or the whole file)."
msgstr "由於伺服器端記錄由客戶端的來源端口作為密鑰，因此只有當客戶端從未更改的端點重新連接時才會檢測到輪換其密鑰對的客戶端；使用作業系統分配的臨時端口，新密鑰將記錄為新端點。客戶端記錄由固定伺服器位址作為金鑰，因此更改的伺服器金鑰始終會被拒絕。若要重置信任（輪換金鑰、新伺服器），請刪除「pub_key.json」條目（或整個檔案）。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:357
#: 2e2770b8dbd743d9997b66ca4c0b169b
msgid "Handshake"
msgstr "握手"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:359
#: 316c540e93e245ab8d77c1b2a69fd925
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The client initiates the exchange by sending a plaintext "
"``/crypto_key_exchange <client-nonce>`` greeting; the server replies with"
" ``/crypto_key_exchange_ack <server-nonce> <need-client-pub> <force>``. "
"Both sides then push their public key files over the file-transfer "
"mechanism (plaintext) and TOFU-check the received key. Both sides switch "
"to encrypted mode only after ``/crypto_ready`` has been received from the"
" peer (so plaintext and ciphertext never interleave on a connection). On "
"later connections the keys are re-exchanged and TOFU-checked again; the "
"exchange is never skipped, only the identity check short-circuits for "
"known keys. Public-key pushes are only accepted from a connection that "
"actually started the handshake, so an arbitrary unauthenticated peer "
"cannot poison the registry."
msgstr ""
"用戶端透過傳送明文「/crypto_key_exchange」問候語來啟動交換；伺服器回覆``/crypto_key_exchange_ack "
"<need-client-pub> "
"<force>``。然後，雙方透過文件傳輸機制（明文）推送其公鑰文件，並對收到的金鑰進行豆腐式檢查。只有在從對等方收到「/crypto_ready」後，雙方才會切換到加密模式（因此明文和密文永遠不會在連線上交錯）。在以後的連接中，密鑰將被重新交換並再次進行"
" TOFU 檢查；交換永遠不會被跳過，只有已知密鑰的身份檢查會短路。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:373
#: 7fae06befb8b4202882c4c2f23b7d29d
msgid "Replay protection"
msgstr "重播保護"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:375
#: ee63ab59612d4d739c69aa71b47e1b4f
msgid ""
"The handshake exchanges a random session nonce, and every encrypted line "
"on the wire carries it plus a per-connection sequence number: ``<sender-"
"nonce>|<seq>|<ciphertext>``. The receiver drops a line whose nonce does "
"not match the current session (ciphertext replayed from an older "
"connection) or whose sequence number is not the expected one (ciphertext "
"replayed within the session / out of order); both counters reset when the"
" socket flips to encrypted mode after a (re-)exchange."
msgstr ""
"握手交換隨機會話隨機數，線路上的每條加密線路都攜帶它加上每個連接的序號：``<sender-"
"nonce>|<seq>|<ciphertext>``。接收方丟棄隨機數與目前會話不符的行（從舊連接重播的密文）或其序號不是預期的行（會話內重播的密文/亂序）；當套接字在（重新）交換後切換到加密模式時，兩個計數器都會重置。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:384
#: e8f0295eaf384ef4adf01be3d9323227
msgid "Decode verification and key rotation"
msgstr "解碼驗證和金鑰輪換"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:386
#: e00cf854a2254846b29a95a6c10bc79a
msgid ""
"Every encrypted plaintext carries the fixed suffix ``_VALID`` (separated "
"by ``_``). If a message cannot be decrypted, or the suffix is missing, "
"the socket drops out of encrypted mode, the local key is reloaded, and a "
"forced ``/crypto_key_exchange`` restarts the handshake so both sides re-"
"push their current public keys. The re-exchange itself re-runs the TOFU "
"check: a peer whose key did not change is accepted again, while a peer "
"presenting a *different* key for a recorded endpoint is rejected (see the"
" TOFU section above). A user who intentionally rotates a keypair must "
"delete the stale ``pub_key.json`` entry (or the whole file) on the peer "
"side to re-trust the new key."
msgstr ""
"每個加密明文都帶有固定後綴“_VALID”（以“_”分隔）。如果訊息無法解密，或後綴遺失，則套接字退出加密模式，重新載入本機金鑰，並強制「/crypto_key_exchange」重新啟動握手，以便雙方重新推送其目前的公鑰。重新交換本身會重新執行"
" TOFU 檢查：金鑰未變更的對等點將再次被接受，而為記錄的端點提供「不同」金鑰的對等點將被拒絕（請參閱上面的 TOFU "
"部分）。故意輪換金鑰對的使用者必須刪除對等端過時的「pub_key.json」條目（或整個檔案）才能重新信任新金鑰。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:397
#: f3b3e918186c44a1b4af09e78d4ac519
msgid ""
"Re-exchanges are circuit-broken: after ``MAX_DECODE_FAILURES`` (3) "
"consecutive decode failures on one connection the connection is closed "
"instead of re-exchanging, so a garbage-injection or persistent-mismatch "
"storm cannot spin the loop forever. A successful decryption resets the "
"counter."
msgstr ""
"重新交換是斷路的：在一個連接上「MAX_DECODE_FAILURES」(3) "
"連續解碼失敗後，連接將關閉而不是重新交換，因此垃圾注入或持久不匹配風暴無法永遠旋轉循環。成功解密會重置計數器。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:411
#: 176938ef99394d1489df701ea317349c
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `broadcast` function sends a message to all clients in the "
"``self.clients`` dictionary and removes clients that are already "
"disconnected from the server. And if the ``exclude_client`` parameter is "
"not ``None``, the server will exclude the client which is specified by "
"the ``exclude_client`` parameter when sending the message."
msgstr "在「broadcast」函數中，它將向「self.clients」變數中的所有用戶端發送訊息，並刪除已經與伺服器斷開連接的用戶端。如果“exclude_client”參數不是“None”，則伺服器在傳送訊息時將排除“exclude_client”參數指定的用戶端。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:425
#: e82fe4023aaa49f6aff7aa9e53f5024a
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `send_msg_to_specific_client` function sends one or more messages to "
"one or more specific clients by their client IDs. The ``message`` "
"argument should contain a command message to send."
msgstr ""
"`send_msg_to_specific_client` 函數用於透過客戶端 ID "
"向一個或多個特定客戶端發送一條或多個訊息。並且“message”參數應該輸入發送訊息命令。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:429
#: ad4051bc6da045b4b8297b98467d1454
msgid ""
"These methods form the server's client I/O loop and ensure reliable "
