"transfers. They handle the coordination of transfer ports, client "
"connections, and the actual file data transfer operations.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：文件傳輸 API "
"函數設計為從命令處理程序調用，以進行客戶端啟動和伺服器啟動的傳輸。它們處理傳輸連接埠、客戶端連接和實際檔案資料傳輸操作的協調。 *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:731
#: 19594f7553f949f5a28e98086e174d67
msgid "Client-to-server transfer flow:"
msgstr "客戶端到伺服器的傳輸流程："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:733
#: 04ed43ebd0dc4a499892ab47729392ec
msgid "The client sends ``/file`` or ``/file_folder`` to request a transfer."
msgstr "客戶端發送``/file`` 或``/file_folder`` 來請求傳輸。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:735
#: fb8a02b24bc340029cd2db82e193913b
msgid ""
"``handle_command`` starts a dedicated file-server thread using "
"``file_transfer_server_recv_server_start_thread``."
msgstr "「handle_command」使用「file_transfer_server_recv_server_start_thread」啟動專用檔案伺服器執行緒。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:737
#: 8d6c981f92f64463b2d38e8206546ed6
msgid ""
"The server allocates an ephemeral transfer port with ``palloc`` and sends"
" ``/server_file_transfer_port <port> <client_id>`` back to the client."
msgstr ""
"伺服器使用“palloc”分配臨時傳輸連接埠並將“/server_file_transfer_port <port> "
"<client_id>”傳回客戶端。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:741
#: 2d7de7cdebd24d7491e9d754a3f2ccde
msgid ""
"The client connects to that transfer port and sends file metadata, "
"including length-prefixed filename and file size."
msgstr "用戶端連接到該傳輸連接埠並發送文件元數據，包括帶有長度前綴的檔案名稱和檔案大小。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:744
#: 6c6611f2090443aa9a2357f562ff7b07
msgid "The server receives the file and writes it under ``received_files``."
msgstr "伺服器接收檔案並將其寫入“received_files”下。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:747
#: 020a4b95ca2346d295ce909129c9f4a2
msgid "Server-to-client transfer flow:"
msgstr "伺服器到客戶端的傳輸流程："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:749
#: 094a6e0c4a754ea69cfad07bc2eb0e0c
msgid ""
"``file_transfer_server_recv_client_start`` is used to initiate outgoing "
"transfers from server to a connected client."
msgstr "``file_transfer_server_recv_client_start`` 用於啟動從伺服器到連線的客戶端的傳出傳輸。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:751
#: 800a8aa72eb2412e8d223397f02aba3c
msgid ""
"The server sends transfer commands to the client socket and waits for the"
" client to establish the file transfer connection."
msgstr "伺服器向客戶端套接字發送傳輸命令，並等待客戶端建立檔案傳輸連線。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:753
#: 41b3ccd39aab4c828bf68e5e311ba86a
msgid ""
"Folder transfers are performed recursively, with each file transfer "
"respecting ``self.max_file_transfer_thread_num`` and the configured "
"semaphore limit."
msgstr "資料夾傳輸以遞歸方式執行，每個檔案傳輸都遵循“self.max_file_transfer_thread_num”和配置的信號量限制。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:756
#: 1faa5c773fdd49e1b26facf79263c417
msgid "Common file transfer helper methods include:"
msgstr "常見的文件傳輸幫助方法包括："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:758
#: e11f8b38425e4f3aa740c9ee7b86cec3
msgid ""
"``file_transfer_server_recv_server_start``: receives file data from a "
"client."
msgstr "``file_transfer_server_recv_server_start``：從客戶端接收檔案資料。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:759
#: 747917ad42a441808e5045cedaf3d392
msgid ""
"``file_transfer_server_recv_client_start``: sends a file or folder to a "
"client."
msgstr "``file_transfer_server_recv_client_start``：將檔案或資料夾傳送到客戶端。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:760
#: 42b7d8d306e140178b80bdccb8e14b49
msgid ""
"``file_transfer_mode``: performs the low-level client-side transfer "
"handshake."
msgstr "``file_transfer_mode``：執行低階客戶端傳輸握手。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:761
#: 927d9ae384444c27b258290e954baabf
msgid ""
"``file_transfer_mode_recv``: performs the low-level receive-side transfer"
" handshake."
msgstr "``file_transfer_mode_recv``：執行低階接收端傳輸握手。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:766
#: 15f3dfc76bb44e19ac4da59a968fdf76
msgid "Port allocation API"
msgstr "連接埠分配API"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:768
#: a3ad841e314c456eba6c9f0df5170d62
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The server allocation APIs allow you to allocate a new port for other "
"servers. There are two kinds of port allocation modes."
msgstr "伺服器分配 API 允許您為其他伺服器指派新連接埠。連接埠分配方式有兩種。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:772
#: 30e73757dd26448db445ae17617b8977
msgid ""
"To change the port allocation mode, you can set the "
"``is_hand_alloc_port`` argument on the server instance. When set to "
"``False``, the server instance will choose the automatic port allocation "
"mode, or set to ``True`` it will choose the manual allocation mode."
msgstr "若要變更連接埠分配模式，您可以在伺服器實例上設定“is_hand_alloc_port”參數。當設定為“False”時，伺服器實例將選擇自動連接埠分配模式，或設定為“True”時，伺服器實例將選擇手動分配模式。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:778
#: 50df3e4d08164db6832c55ed2b970e38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend using the automatic port allocation mode, which is "
"the default mode of the server, because the automatic port allocation "
"mode is more simple and also more stable than the manual port allocation "
"mode. In this mode, when calling the allocation APIs, it will return "
"``0``."
msgstr "我們最推薦您使用自動連接埠分配模式，這是伺服器的預設模式，因為自動連接埠分配模式比手動連接埠分配模式更簡單，也更穩定。在此模式下，呼叫分配API時，將傳回``0``。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:785
#: 7b72dd8cb85b40168b2f74ea364c934d
msgid ""
"*Note: The `bind` function in standard lib `socket` of the python "
"executor, when input ``0`` to the port parameter, will automatically "
"assign an available port by operating system.*"
msgstr "*注意：python執行器的標準lib `socket`中的`bind`函數，當連接埠參數輸入``0`時，作業系統會自動分配一個可用的連接埠。 *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:790
#: 95dfca218b41428492ec7edaff4d8c76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The other port allocation mode is the manual port allocation mode, there "
"is a port allocation range for the server. Please avoid opening other "
"servers in the same host, because in the existing version, the port range"
" may conflict and may cause unexpected errors."
msgstr "另一種連接埠分配方式是手動連接埠分配方式，伺服器有一個連接埠分配範圍。請避免在同一台主機上開啟其他伺服器，因為在現有版本中，連接埠分配範圍會發生衝突，並可能導致一些意外錯誤。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:797
#: d04ec5c612444ee6ab343a5267eefae6
msgid ""
"The range of the port allocation is configured in the server settings. "
"The minimum allocatable port is ``self.port-"
"self.port_add_step*self.port_range_num``, and the maximum allocatable "
"port is ``self.port+1+self.port_add_step*self.port_range_num``."
msgstr ""
"連接埠分配的範圍在伺服器設定中配置。最小可分配連接埠為“self.port-"
"self.port_add_step*self.port_range_num”，最大可指派連接埠為“self.port+1+self.port_add_step*self.port_range_num”。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:803
#: b968b1c85c994c30a471d076ac5f8302
msgid ""
"*Note: The ``self.port`` is the ``port`` argument of the server class. "
"The ``self.port_add_step`` is the ``port_add_step`` argument. And the "
"``self.port_range_num`` is the ``port_range_num`` argument.*"
msgstr ""
"*注意：「self.port」是伺服器類別的「port」參數。 “self.port_add_step” 是“port_add_step” 參數。"
" ``self.port_range_num`` 是``port_range_num`` 參數。 *"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:809
#: ae4d9949a4da4c2cb9f9ad22fbc8a2a7
msgid "There are some relevant methods that can be used:"
msgstr "有一些相關的方法可以使用："

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:816
#: fd02fb350d854684913db2c86285642a
msgid ""
"The `palloc` method allows you to get a port. When using this function, "
"you don't need to worry about the port allocation mode, because an "
"allocation mode detector is already implemented in this method."
msgstr "`palloc` 方法可讓您取得連接埠。使用此函數時，您無需擔心連接埠指派模式，因為此方法中已經實作了分配模式偵測器。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:828
#: 6eac38162c1548d6b24fbd2f4759947a
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `pfree` method allows you to free a port. Like the `palloc` method, "
"you don't need to worry about the port allocation mode when using this "
"method."
msgstr "`pfree` 方法允許您釋放一個端口，與 `palloc` 方法相同，使用該方法時不需要關心端口分配模式。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:832
#: 87e3a9c6110b43d296190d6dc82ac77e
msgid ""
"And there are the main functions for you to call, and for more "
"information about the port allocation functions, see the :ref:`tcp-"
"server-port-allocation-api` section."
msgstr "還有主要的函數供您調用，有關連接埠分配函數的更多信息，請參閱 :ref:`tcp-server-port-allocation-api` 部分。"

#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:836
#: 554e019e9bac4a1b9f9a602e656ce1be
msgid ""
"This mode is useful when you need an individual port for the server or  "
"must reserve a controlled range of ports for client-file transfers by "
"manual port allocation, such as in a testing environment or when multiple"
" server processes share the same host."
msgstr "當您需要伺服器的單獨連接埠或必須透過手動連接埠指派為用戶端檔案傳輸保留受控連接埠範圍時（例如在測試環境中或多個伺服器進程共用相同主機時），此模式非常有用。"

